# Build context for platform/Dockerfile is the repo root (it needs platform/, agent-runtime/schema and web-tools/schema). The UI has its own
# image and context (ui/Dockerfile, ui/.dockerignore, D52), so ui/ stays out and a UI-only change never touches this image.
# Everything the image does not need stays out so rebuilds are fast and cache-friendly.
.git
.claude
.github
# 저장소 뿌리의 로컬 작업 폴더(<이름>-dev). .env 와 kubeconfig 가 있을 수 있어 빌드 컨텍스트로 도커 데몬에 보내지 않는다
*-dev
docs
spike
deploy
# 설치 차트(P85). 이미지에 들지 않고, 운영자의 값 파일이 빌드 컨텍스트로 가지 않게 뺀다
charts
# 운영자의 설치(ops/ 가 있는 저장소에만 있다, P85 9절). 그 값과 스크립트가 빌드 컨텍스트로 가지 않게 뺀다
ops
mcp-runtime
scripts
# agent-runtime: the platform image only needs the agent.json contract (platform/Dockerfile copies
# agent-runtime/schema/agent.schema.json). The runtime code has its own image (make image-agent).
agent-runtime/*
!agent-runtime/schema
agent-runtime/schema/fixtures
agent-runtime/schema/check.py
# web-tools: the platform image only needs the tool contract (platform/Dockerfile copies web-tools/schema/tools.json)
web-tools/*
!web-tools/schema
# sandbox: the code execution workspace image has its own context (sandbox/Dockerfile, P40)
sandbox
**/.venv
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
**/.pytest_cache
**/.ruff_cache
**/.mypy_cache
platform/tests
platform/data
platform/daegam/ui_dist
ui
*.log
